  :summary "VDOM Multi-Element SVG AST, Physics Engine Mathematics & Quantum Circuit Emission: fix parse-all-children in asn_svg to parse all sibling shape tags rather than dropping after the first match; calculate true Euclidean length in physics_reactor Hooke law; and format circuit gate operations into OpenQASM in asl-quantum."
  :phase "Phase479VdomSvgParserAndPhysicsReactorCorrections"
  :baseline "Empirically detected in monorepo audit. vdom/src/asn_svg.asl parse-all-children uses single-occurrence extraction, silently dropping all subsequent sibling shapes of the same kind (:rc, :circ, :ln, :poly, :p, :txt) from generated SVG; vdom/src/physics_reactor.asl hooke-spring-force computes distance as (+ (* dx dx) (* dy dy)) without sqrt, producing quadratic non-Hookean runaway forces; and asl-quantum/src/emit-qasm.asl completely drops circuit gate operations."
